{"type":"message","id":"26c55cd5","parentId":"0b094acb","timestamp":"2026-06-01T13:22:35.691Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6eec37a8b4acb3cc30797610a91\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-06-01 13:22 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6eec37a8b4acb3cc30797610a91]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: 跟你私聊和你在群聊里的记忆不共享吧"}],"timestamp":1780320155652}}
{"type":"message","id":"54f76b98","parentId":"26c55cd5","timestamp":"2026-06-01T13:22:40.536Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Boss is asking whether private chat memory and group chat memory are shared. Let me check my memory to understand what I know about this.\n\nBased on my memory files, I know that:\n- MEMORY.md contains long-term memory\n- Daily notes are in memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md\n- These are loaded at session startup\n\nBut the question is specifically about whether private chat (DM) and group chat contexts share memory. Let me think about this...\n\nActually, each session in OpenClaw is separate. The DM with boss is one session, and group chats would be different sessions/agents. So memory from one chat wouldn't automatically transfer to another unless it's written to the shared memory files (MEMORY.md or daily memory files).\n\n\nSo they don't share automatically - any shared information would need to be explicitly written to those files.\n","thinkingSignature":"0b62e3afa49d469fd00e906c4157d7cdd7560609ad4951e298e7b33d037bb116"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n不共享。\n\nOpenClaw 里每个会话（DM/群聊/子 agent）是独立内存上下文，交叉不自动传染。\n\n**实际意思：**\n- 你在私聊里告诉我的 → 存在我这次的 session 里，换个群聊我就不知道\n- 但我写成文件（MEMORY.md / daily notes）→ 下次启动任何会话都能读\n\n**所以：**\n跨群/跨聊天要保持记忆，得显式写文件。不然聊完就忘。\n\n你是在测试还是在规划什么？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":27390,"output":276,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27762,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780320155758,"responseId":"066cba9c9b56262b67a8fc9bddfc26a8"}}
{"type":"message","id":"9fd7374e","parentId":"54f76b98","timestamp":"2026-06-01T13:24:20.661Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6eeccec918a4b34f9cc911597ef\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-06-01 13:24 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6eeccec918a4b34f9cc911597ef]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: 如何建立跨聊天的记忆"}],"timestamp":1780320260621}}
{"type":"message","id":"8bc28d7d","parentId":"9fd7374e","timestamp":"2026-06-01T13:24:30.248Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking how to establish cross-chat memory. This is a practical question about how to make information shared across different chat contexts in OpenClaw. Let me think about the options:\n\n1. **Files (MEMORY.md, daily notes)** - The most reliable way. Write important info to files, and read them at session startup.\n\n2. **AGENTS.md rules** - Can specify that certain information should be persisted.\n\n3. **Memory system** - Using memory_search/memory_get tools to store and retrieve.\n\nLet me give a concise, practical answer.\n","thinkingSignature":"240adaed09dcf8f65162612cd34cc517f76a0a7321e7af6bdc70c393ef4283f9"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n两个层面：\n\n## 1. 写入文件（持久层）\n\n**长期记忆：** `MEMORY.md`\n- 你告诉我的重要偏好、决策、教训\n- 下次任何 session 启动都会读\n\n**短期/日记录：** `memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md`\n- 当天发生的事，次日可合并到 MEMORY.md\n\n**格式：**\n```\n## [主题]\n- 关键事实\n- 重要决策\n```\n\n## 2. 会话启动时读取（AGENTS.md 规定）\n\n每次新会话启动，我按 AGENTS.md 的规则顺序读取：\n```\nSOUL.md → USER.md → memory/今天+昨天 → MEMORY.md\n```\n\n所以**你要我记住什么，直接说\"写到 MEMORY.md\"** 就行，下次任何聊天我都知道。\n\n---\n\n**实际用法：**\n- 私聊里说：\"把这个记到 MEMORY.md\"\n- 群聊里问：\"MEMORY.md 里关于 X 怎么写的？\"\n\n要我把你刚才的某个偏好或决定写进去吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":27532,"output":332,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27864,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780320260668,"responseId":"066cbb0541e2311c4c912b6e81b23c08"}}
{"type":"message","id":"ecc9ed81","parentId":"8bc28d7d","timestamp":"2026-06-01T13:26:01.732Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6eecc88750bcb48e3298fcc2556\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-06-01 13:25 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6eecc88750bcb48e3298fcc2556]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: 配置里哪些配置影响这些记忆的形成"}],"timestamp":1780320361694}}
{"type":"message","id":"f735757a","parentId":"ecc9ed81","timestamp":"2026-06-01T13:26:07.511Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking which configurations affect memory formation. Let me think about what configurations in OpenClaw affect memory:\n\n1. `memory.promotion` settings - which determine what gets promoted from short-term to long-term memory\n2. Memory file paths\n3. Session context loading rules in AGENTS.md\n4. Various memory-related configurations\n\nLet me check the config schema and relevant docs to give accurate information.\n","thinkingSignature":"81eb4784d5db189f2ffb2db414bc871b559fadb9a853b7ecf911153d373e04cd"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n查一下配置 schema 里跟 memory 相关的字段。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_krcgvlg80azp_1","name":"gateway","arguments":{"action":"config.schema.lookup","path":"memory"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_krcgvlg80azp_2","name":"gateway","arguments":{"action":"config.schema.lookup","path":"agents"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1923,"output":163,"cacheRead":25885,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27971,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780320361792,"responseId":"066cbb6a6686915c21c522293257d5ae"}}
