"imsg\": {\n            \"enabled\": false\n          },\n          \"mcporter\": {\n            \"enabled\": false\n          },\n          \"model-usage\": {\n            \"enabled\": false\n          },\n          \"nano-pdf\": {\n            \"enabled\": false\n          },\n          \"obsidian\": {\n            \"enabled\": false\n          },\n          \"openai-whisper\": {\n            \"enabled\": false\n          },\n          \"openai-whisper-api\": {\n            \"enabled\": false\n          },\n          \"openhue\": {\n            \"enabled\": false\n          },\n          \"oracle\": {\n            \"enabled\": false\n          },\n          \"ordercli\": {\n            \"enabled\": false\n          },\n          \"peekaboo\": {\n            \"enabled\": false\n          },\n          \"sag\": {\n            \"enabled\": false\n          },\n          \"session-logs\": {\n            \"enabled\": false\n          },\n          \"sherpa-onnx-tts\": {\n            \"enabled\": false\n          },\n          \"slack\": {\n            \"enabled\": false\n          },\n          \"songsee\": {\n            \"enabled\": false\n          },\n          \"sonoscli\": {\n            \"enabled\": false\n          },\n          \"spotify-player\": {\n            \"enabled\": false\n          },\n          \"things-mac\": {\n            \"enabled\": false\n          },\n          \"tmux\": {\n            \"enabled\": false\n          },\n          \"trello\": {\n            \"enabled\": false\n          },\n          \"video-frames\": {\n            \"enabled\": false\n          },\n          \"voice-call\": {\n            \"enabled\": false\n          },\n          \"wacli\": {\n            \"enabled\": false\n          },\n          \"xurl\": {\n            \"enabled\": false\n          },\n          \"summarize\": {\n            \"enabled\": false\n          },\n          \"doc-summarize-pro\": {\n            \"enabled\": true\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"plugins\": {\n        \"allow\": [\n          \"duckduckgo\",\n          \"feishu\",\n          \"google\",\n          \"memory-core\",\n          \"minimax\",\n          \"nvidia\",\n          \"openclaw-weixin\",\n          \"tavily\",\n          \"volcengine\",\n          \"zai\"\n        ],\n        \"entries\": {\n          \"duckduckgo\": {\n            \"enabled\": true,\n            \"config\": {}\n          },\n          \"memory-core\": {\n            \"enabled\": true,\n            \"config\": {\n              \"dreaming\": {\n                \"enabled\": true,\n                \"timezone\": \"Asia/Shanghai\",\n                \"frequency\": \"0 3 * * *\"\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          \"feishu\": {\n            \"enabled\": true,\n            \"config\": {}\n          },\n          \"tavily\": {\n            \"enabled\": true,\n            \"config\": {}\n          },\n          \"minimax\": {\n            \"enabled\": true,\n            \"config\": {}\n          },\n          \"volcengine\": {\n            \"enabled\": true,\n            \"config\": {}\n          },\n          \"zai\": {\n            \"enabled\": true,\n            \"config\": {}\n          },\n          \"google\": {\n            \"enabled\": true,\n            \"config\": {}\n          },\n          \"nvidia\": {\n            \"enabled\": true,\n            \"config\": {}\n          },\n          \"openclaw-weixin\": {\n            \"enabled\": true,\n            \"config\": {}\n          }\n        },\n        \"bundledDiscovery\": \"compat\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"hash\": \"9b91f0f413b742ededf0596c01a3569d15890083b87e27b983f570a6c2111144\",\n    \"issues\": [],\n    \"warnings\": [],\n    \"legacyIssues\": []\n  }\n}[... 98372 more characters truncated]"}],"details":{"persistedDetailsTruncated":true,"originalDetailsBytesAtLeast":8193,"originalDetailKeys":["ok","result"]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780320386721}}
{"type":"message","id":"2d6596f4","parentId":"1e4f3c5b","timestamp":"2026-06-01T13:26:39.623Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a comprehensive picture of the config. Let me synthesize the relevant parts that affect memory formation:\n\n1. **agents.defaults.workspace** - 每个 agent 的 workspace 路径不同，文件存在各自 workspace 下\n2. **agents.defaults.memorySearch** - 启用了 memory search，用 gemini text-embedding-004\n3. **hooks.internal.entries.session-memory** - session-memory hook 启用（这是关键！）\n4. **session** 相关配置：\n   - dmScope: \"per-account-channel-peer\" - 每次 DM 是独立 session\n   - maintenance.pruneAfter: \"10d\" - 10天后清理\n5. **agents.list** - 多个 agent，各有独立 workspace\n\n关键洞察：\n\n\nsession-memory hook 会在每次会话启动时自动加载 MEMORY.md 和 daily notes，文件层面通过 workspace 隔离各自的数据，而 memorySearch 让跨文件的语义搜索成为可能。\n","thinkingSignature":"ac818e48ecacc5651a36e53361f276aabad7d94b09cf36e9167265264b32760b"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n配置里影响记忆形成的核心部分：\n\n## 1. Workspace 隔离（根本原因）\n\n```json\nagents.defaults.workspace    → \"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace\"\nagents.list[].workspace      → 每个 agent 不同路径\n```\n\n你的 main agent 在 `~/.openclaw/workspace/`，MEMORY.md 在那里。群聊里的 Talus 如果是另一个 agent 实例，workspace 不同，MEMORY.md 就不一样。\n\n## 2. 关键 Hook（负责读文件）\n\n```json\nhooks.internal.entries.session-memory.enabled → true\n```\n\n这个 hook 在每次 session 启动时触发，读取 workspace 里的 `.md` 文件（SOUL.md / MEMORY.md / daily notes）。**这个 hook 关闭就不读文件了。**\n\n## 3. Session 隔离粒度\n\n```json\nsession.dmScope → \"per-account-channel-peer\"\n```\n\n每个 sender × channel × account 组合 = 独立 session。上次私聊和这次私聊如果 sender 相同，会复用餐上下文，不会开新 session。但群聊 @我 是另一个 session。\n\n## 4. Memory Search（语义搜索）\n\n```json\nagents.defaults.memorySearch.enabled → true\nagents.defaults.memorySearch.provider → \"gemini\"\nagents.defaults.memorySearch.model → \"text-embedding-004\"\n```\n\n这是 `memory_search` 工具的后端——我调用时会先搜索文件再读内容。搜索结果决定上下文注入哪些记忆片段。\n\n---\n\n**总结：记忆形成 = workspace 文件 + session-memory hook 读取 + memorySearch 检索。**\n\n你想让某个群聊也共享 main 的记忆，最直接的办法是让那个群聊里的 agent 也用同一个 workspace，或者在那个 agent 启动时把 MEMORY.md 软链接过去。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":26864,"output":552,"cacheRead":28608,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56024,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780320386731,"responseId":"066cbb83a57ba560222753d77e0173ba"}}
{"type":"message","id":"406a8a40","parentId":"2d6596f4","timestamp":"2026-06-01T13:29:01.717Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6eecdf479cacb2952bb2eb1582f\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-06-01 13:28 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6eecdf479cacb2952bb2eb1582f]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: 回答我哦，openclaw有哪些配置是跟建立记忆有关的"}],"timestamp":1780320541677}}
{"type":"message","id":"576aab4e","parentId":"406a8a40","timestamp":"2026-06-01T13:29:11.519Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to give a clearer, more structured answer about which OpenClaw configurations are related to building memory. My previous answer was a bit scattered. Let me organize this more clearly.\n\nKey configs related to memory formation:\n\n1. `agents.defaults.workspace` - sets the base workspace path\n2. `session.dmScope` / `session.scope` - controls session isolation\n3. `hooks.internal.entries.session-memory` - the actual hook that reads memory files at session start\n4. `agents.defaults.memorySearch` - enables semantic search over memory\n5. `memory` section itself - memory backend and citation settings\n\n\n6. Now I'll structure this into a clean, comprehensive list so it's easy to reference.\n","thinkingSignature":"e32f12fc01b25152d0c85e53546f0abd4071d2649a46d398a383588f0e8700f5"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n影响记忆的核心配置，分两类：\n\n## 负责「读进来」\n\n| 配置 | 作用 |\n|------|------|\n| `hooks.internal.entries.session-memory` | session 启动时读取 workspace 里的 .md 文件（SOUL/USER/MEMORY/daily），关掉就不读 |\n| `agents.defaults.workspace` | 读哪些文件从这里找路径 |\n| `session.dmScope` / `session.scope` | 决定新消息是否复用已有 session，还是开新 session（影响上下文是否连续） |\n\n## 负责「搜到」\n\n| 配置 | 作用 |\n|------|------|\n| `agents.defaults.memorySearch.enabled` | 开启语义搜索（我调用 memory_search 工具时搜哪些文件） |\n| `agents.defaults.memorySearch.provider` / `model` | 语义搜索用的 embedding 模型 |\n| `memory.backend` | 记忆后端：builtin（内置）还是 qmd（旁路） |\n\n## 负责「写进去」\n\n这部分没有特定配置开关——靠我执行 `write` 工具把内容落地到 workspace 里的 .md 文件。\n\n---\n\n**最小记忆骨架：**\n```\nsession-memory hook = on\nworkspace = 同一个目录\n→ 每次启动都会读 MEMORY.md + daily notes\n```\n\n**你现在的状态：** main agent 的 workspace 是 `~/.openclaw/workspace/`，MEMORY.md 在那里，所以私聊记得。但群聊如果是另一个 session 或另一个 agent，workspace 不同就不记得。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":9710,"output":463,"cacheRead":25794,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":35967,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780320541721,"responseId":"066cbc1e180a7130a5146abf3772cbf3"}}
{"type":"message","id":"cfd04a57","parentId":"576aab4e","timestamp":"2026-06-01T13:51:01.313Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6eecaacba0a0b2e04de126cdbfc\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-06-01 13:50 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6eecaacba0a0b2e04de126cdbfc]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff:\n \"session\": {\n \"reset\": {\n \"mode\": \"idle\",\n \"idleMinutes\": 43200\n }\n },\n \"agents\": {\n \"defaults\": {\n \"compaction\": {\n \"mode\": \"safeguard\"\n }\n }\n },\n \"plugins\": {\n \"entries\": {\n \"openclaw-openmemory\": {\n \"enabled\": true,\n \"config\": {\n \"autoCapture\": true,\n \"autoRecall\": true,\n \"topK\": 10\n }\n }\n }\n }\n看一下这些配置有道理么"}],"timestamp":1780321861274}}
{"type":"message","id":"13a456a1","parentId":"cfd04a57","timestamp":"2026-06-01T13:51:16.259Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is showing me some OpenClaw config values and asking if they make sense. Let me analyze:\n\n1. `session.reset.mode = \"idle\"` with `idleMinutes = 43200` (43200 minutes = 30 days). This means after 30 days of inactivity, the session resets.\n\n2. `agents.defaults.compaction.mode = \"safeguard\"` - safeguard mode is a compaction setting.\n\n3. `plugins.entries.openclaw-openmemory` - this is an OpenClaw memory plugin with autoCapture and autoRecall enabled, topK = 10.\n\nLet me think about whether these make sense:\n\n\nThe 30-day idle reset is quite conservative for a personal agent like Talus—most users would prefer their conversation history preserved longer, though it could serve as a safety net. The openclaw-openmemory plugin appears to be a separate memory system running alongside the built-in session hook, which could create redundancy unless it's genuinely more capable. The compaction mode on safeguard is also worth considering in context.\n","thinkingSignature":"463a2391b012efe7fba833cf5e4f4c97f0bd1a41c52667a1888757ab81b25c08"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n逐条看：\n\n## 1. `session.reset.idleMinutes = 43200`\n\n**43200 分钟 = 30 天。** 意味着一个 session  idle 30 天后会重置。\n\n对个人助理来说偏久。你可能几个月不聊某个群，然后突然回来发现记忆还在，但 session 已经断了——这个 30 天是兜底保守策略。**合理，但偏安全。**\n\n如果你希望 session 更短保留（比如 7 天），调到 `10080`。\n\n## 2. `compaction.mode = \"safeguard\"`\n\n`safeguard` 模式是保守模式——只在大意/安全触发时压缩，不主动整理。**合理**，不会频繁重写上下文导致丢失重要内容。\n\n但也意味着上下文增长到限值前不会自动整理，适合内存充足的环境。\n\n## 3. `openclaw-openmemory` 插件\n\n```json\nautoCapture: true   → 自动抓取记忆\nautoRecall: true    → 自动召回\ntopK: 10            → 召回 10 条最相关的记忆\n```\n\n**这个插件和我上面说的 session-memory hook 是两套并行的记忆系统。**\n\n- `session-memory` hook 读的是 workspace 里的 .md 文件\n- `openclaw-openmemory` 是另一个插件，可能有自己的存储和检索机制\n\n**问题：**\n- 两套同时跑，可能记忆重复写入，浪费 token\n- `autoCapture` 会自动把对话内容写进记忆，可能不是你想要的（隐私/噪音）\n- 如果 openmemory 已经覆盖了 session-memory 的功能，hook 其实可以关掉\n\n---\n\n**总体判断：**\n- 如果 `openclaw-openmemory` 已经在替你做记忆管理，session-memory hook 可以考虑禁用（减少重复读取）\n- 30 天 idle 偏长，看你需求\n- `autoCapture: true` 建议确认：它会往哪里写？写的粒度是什么？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":35975,"output":602,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36577,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780321861388,"responseId":"066cc1467a92c70661923db5804245a3"}}
{"type":"message","id":"76af30da","parentId":"13a456a1","timestamp":"2026-06-01T14:01:57.499Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6eed43cbf934b3b7510cb0e4e86\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-06-01 14:01 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6eed43cbf934b3b7510cb0e4e86]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: Openclaw自带的记忆管理是什么"}],"timestamp":1780322517449}}
{"type":"message","id":"c783da8b","parentId":"76af30da","timestamp":"2026-06-01T14:02:17.905Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Boss is asking what OpenClaw's built-in memory management is. Let me think about what I know from the config and the conversation.\n\nFrom the config, I see:\n1. `openclaw-openmemory` plugin - this seems to be an external/additional memory plugin\n2. `hooks.internal.entries.session-memory` - this hook reads .md files from workspace\n3. `agents.defaults.memorySearch` - semantic search configuration\n\nThe built-in memory system seems to consist of:\n1. Session-memory hook - reads .md files at session startup (SOUL.md, USER.md, MEMORY.md, memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md)\n\n\n2. The workspace files themselves (MEMORY.md, daily notes) that function as long-term memory storage\n3. A semantic search capability via memory_search that sits on top of these files\n4. The memory backend itself with builtin and qmd options\n\nSo the openmemory plugin is actually separate from OpenClaw's core memory management - it's an additional layer on top of the built-in system, which is really just file-based storage through the session-memory hook and memory_search functionality.\n","thinkingSignature":"cbbf466344a505088b0d6bf87c545c895397522d85370c4312b734d160758cfd"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n根据配置和代码，OpenClaw 自带的记忆系统有两层：\n\n## 1. session-memory hook（内置核心）\n\nsession 启动时自动读取 workspace 里的文件：\n- `SOUL.md` — 我是谁\n- `USER.md` — 你是谁\n- `MEMORY.md` — 长期记忆\n- `memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md` — 每日记录\n\n**纯文件，不入库。** 每次启动都是一个 session lifecycle：启动 → 读文件 → 对话 → 结束时可能压缩存档。不依赖数据库。\n\n## 2. memory_search 工具\n\n我调用时搜这些文件的语义内容，用 embedding 模型（`text-embedding-004`）做相似度检索。\n\n## 3. 记忆持久化方式\n\n| 方式 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| **文件（默认）** | 直接读写 .md 文件 |\n| **compaction** | 对话过长时压缩上下文到文件 |\n| **session store** | 落在 `~/.openclaw/sessions.json`，保存完整会话历史 |\n\n---\n\n## openmemory 插件 ≠ 内置\n\n你配置里的 `openclaw-openmemory` 是**额外的插件**，不是 OpenClaw 自带的。它自己管存储和召回，走自己的流程，不走 .md 文件。\n\n**两套并行时的区别：**\n```\n内置 session-memory     → 读 .md 文件，每次启动都读，显式存储\nopenmemory plugin       → 自管理，可能是向量库/数据库，隐式自动记忆\n```\n\n如果你开了 `autoCapture: true`，openmemory 会在对话中自动抓取内容写入自己的存储，对 .md 文件是透明的（两套可能各写各的）。\n\n---\n\n**你的 openmemory 插件从哪来的？** 如果不需要自动记忆，建议确认它的存储位置和行为，或者关掉 `autoCapture` 避免记忆分散在两套系统里。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":2551,"output":618,"cacheRead":33881,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":37050,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780322517561,"responseId":"066cc3d61c6239f25b804c7f293103b2"}}
