{"type":"message","id":"a187c74e","parentId":"845c3fdb","timestamp":"2026-06-01T14:17:46.561Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The config doesn't show `openclaw-openmemory` as a plugin. Let me check what I found:\n\n1. **`session.reset`** - not in current config at all. The current `session` section only has `dmScope` and `maintenance`. No `idleMinutes`.\n\n2. **`agents.defaults.compaction`** - current is `mode: \"default\"`, not `\"safeguard\"`. But `reserveTokensFloor: 30000` is there.\n\n3. **`plugins.entries.openclaw-openmemory`** - not present. The current plugins only include: duckduckgo, memory-core, feishu, tavily, minimax, volcengine, zai, google, nvidia, openclaw-weixin. No openclaw-openmemory.\n   \nSo the user was likely asking me to evaluate the configuration they'd seen from someone else, not what I actually have now. Based on what they're showing me, the idle timeouts are quite permissive—43200 minutes (30 days) for sessions and compaction set to \"safeguard\" mode—though these don't match what's actually running on the system.\n","thinkingSignature":"1c0b1f6d361b08993ec8acd8131c29dfaddb73cfc72fe80bddea756fa938eece"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n基于刚才拉到的完整配置，现状是：\n\n## 你展示的配置 vs 当前运行配置\n\n| 项目 | 你展示的 | 当前运行的 |\n|------|---------|-----------|\n| `session.reset.idleMinutes` | 43200（30天） | **不存在**（没配） |\n| `compaction.mode` | `\"safeguard\"` | `\"default\"` |\n| `openclaw-openmemory` 插件 | 有 | **不存在** |\n\n当前 `session.maintenance` 实际是：\n```json\n\"pruneAfter\": \"10d\",\n\"maxEntries\": 100\n```\n\n---\n\n## 评估\n\n**1. openclaw-openmemory：** 不在你的运行配置里。那个插件是别人配的，你没装。说明那段 JSON 是参考用，不是你现在的配置。\n\n**2. session.reset.idleMinutes：** 没配，不会触发。session idle 重置由 `session.maintenance` 控制（10天清理）。\n\n**3. compaction mode：** 当前是 `default`，比 `safeguard` 积极一点，但都算保守。够用。\n\n---\n\n## 结论\n\n**当前记忆配置是够的：**\n- `session-memory` hook：开 ✅\n- `memorySearch`：开 ✅\n- `compaction`：默认模式 ✅\n- `session.maintenance`：10天清理 ✅\n- `memory-core` 插件（dreaming）：凌晨3点跑 ✅\n\n不需要额外改什么。你之前看到的那套配置比你现在跑的这套更复杂/保守，但不是必需的。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":52719,"output":540,"cacheRead":32945,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":86204,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780323451944,"responseId":"066cc77c1e462f37cf98378f0ccf2ddc"}}
