{"type":"message","id":"119a663d","parentId":"1a949d10","timestamp":"2026-06-01T14:20:11.316Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking \"你拿不到配置嘛\" - basically asking if I can access the configuration. They're pointing out that I couldn't get the config earlier. Let me try again more specifically.\n","thinkingSignature":"08e4bf682fd61315eb2055787d8bfd4be9fd92938286f917de172645dc331173"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_mgh9nny3yes4_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat /home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json 2>/dev/null | python3 -c \"\nimport json, sys\nd = json.load(sys.stdin)\n\n# 记忆相关配置\nprint('=== session.reset ===')\nprint(json.dumps(d.get('session',{}).get('reset','不存在'), indent=2))\n\nprint('=== session.maintenance ===')\nprint(json.dumps(d.get('session',{}).get('maintenance','不存在'), indent=2))\n\nprint('=== agents.defaults.compaction ===')\nprint(json.dumps(d.get('agents',{}).get('defaults',{}).get('compaction','不存在'), indent=2))\n\nprint('=== agents.defaults.memorySearch ===')\nprint(json.dumps(d.get('agents',{}).get('defaults',{}).get('memorySearch','不存在'), indent=2))\n\nprint('=== plugins.entries.openclaw-openmemory ===')\nprint(json.dumps(d.get('plugins',{}).get('entries',{}).get('openclaw-openmemory','不存在'), indent=2))\n\nprint('=== hooks.internal.entries.session-memory ===')\nhooks = d.get('hooks',{}).get('internal',{}).get('entries',{})\nprint(json.dumps(hooks.get('session-memory','不存在'), indent=2))\n\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":10795,"output":320,"cacheRead":34444,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45559,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780323604117,"responseId":"066cc814bd265e7dc5e9d59ad99fb428"}}
{"type":"message","id":"a28a8536","parentId":"119a663d","timestamp":"2026-06-01T14:20:11.574Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_mgh9nny3yes4_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== session.reset ===\n\"\\u4e0d\\u5b58\\u5728\"\n=== session.maintenance ===\n{\n  \"mode\": \"enforce\",\n  \"pruneAfter\": \"10d\",\n  \"maxEntries\": 100\n}\n=== agents.defaults.compaction ===\n{\n  \"mode\": \"default\",\n  \"reserveTokensFloor\": 30000\n}\n=== agents.defaults.memorySearch ===\n{\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"provider\": \"gemini\",\n  \"model\": \"text-embedding-004\"\n}\n=== plugins.entries.openclaw-openmemory ===\n\"\\u4e0d\\u5b58\\u5728\"\n=== hooks.internal.entries.session-memory ===\n{\n  \"enabled\": true\n}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":79,"aggregated":"=== session.reset ===\n\"\\u4e0d\\u5b58\\u5728\"\n=== session.maintenance ===\n{\n  \"mode\": \"enforce\",\n  \"pruneAfter\": \"10d\",\n  \"maxEntries\": 100\n}\n=== agents.defaults.compaction ===\n{\n  \"mode\": \"default\",\n  \"reserveTokensFloor\": 30000\n}\n=== agents.defaults.memorySearch ===\n{\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"provider\": \"gemini\",\n  \"model\": \"text-embedding-004\"\n}\n=== plugins.entries.openclaw-openmemory ===\n\"\\u4e0d\\u5b58\\u5728\"\n=== hooks.internal.entries.session-memory ===\n{\n  \"enabled\": true\n}","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780323611569}}
{"type":"message","id":"f6728a11","parentId":"a28a8536","timestamp":"2026-06-01T14:20:18.323Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the actual config directly from the file. The user is asking \"你拿不到配置嘛\" - \"can't you get the config?\" They might be questioning whether I had access to the raw config or was just doing schema lookups. I had done a `gateway config.get` which returned the full config but it was truncated. Let me give them a clean summary now that I have the actual file contents.\n","thinkingSignature":"6c96e8c85dcf71ae58e1fb648d85c92cbb3f65b698897a9b14f5e317b35dc715"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n拿到了，直接读文件的：\n\n```\nsession.reset           → 不存在（没配）\nsession.maintenance     → mode: enforce, pruneAfter: 10d, maxEntries: 100\nagents.defaults.compaction  → mode: \"default\", reserveTokensFloor: 30000\nagents.defaults.memorySearch → enabled: true, provider: gemini, model: text-embedding-004\nplugins.openclaw-openmemory  → 不存在（没装）\nhooks.session-memory         → enabled: true ✅\n```\n\n结论不变：你展示的那套别人的配置（30天idle、safeguard模式、openmemory插件）你都没装。现在这套够用。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":2616,"output":223,"cacheRead":43064,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45903,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780323611576,"responseId":"066cc81ca8dbfa6f0fbb1dbce2951ca4"}}
{"type":"message","id":"7ce0c2ce","parentId":"f6728a11","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:04:15.161Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6eedb86e80a0c3c3b6602ba8b8a\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-06-01 15:04 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6eedb86e80a0c3c3b6602ba8b8a]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: 那分析一下我现在的配置能达到的效果"}],"timestamp":1780326255114}}
{"type":"message","id":"04907d08","parentId":"7ce0c2ce","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:04:28.115Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to analyze what their current memory configuration actually achieves. Let me synthesize the findings.\n","thinkingSignature":"b0f794830d894e87e782eca6a224dc3e7522b9c4539dd1806f18448438ba67ec"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n当前记忆配置能达到的效果：\n\n## 记忆写入（我主动写）\n\n每次对话中你认为重要的事，我会写成文件：\n- `MEMORY.md` → 长期记忆，重启后还在\n- `memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md` → 每日记录\n\n这是**主动层**，依赖我识别重要内容。\n\n## 记忆读入（自动触发）\n\n```\nsession 启动\n  → hooks.session-memory (enabled=true)\n  → 读取 workspace/ 下的 .md 文件\n  → SOUL.md / USER.md / MEMORY.md / memory/今天+昨天\n```\n\n对话开始前我已经有这些上下文。\n\n## 记忆检索\n\n```\n我调用 memory_search 工具\n  → memorySearch (enabled=true, provider=gemini)\n  → 用 text-embedding-004 语义搜索 .md 文件\n  → 返回相关片段注入上下文\n```\n\n## 会话管理\n\n```\nsession.maintenance\n  → 10天 idle 后清理\n  → 最多保留 100 个 session\n  → enforce 模式（自动执行）\n```\n\nsession 重置不等于记忆消失——记忆在 .md 文件里，不在 session 里。\n\n---\n\n## 实际效果\n\n| 场景 | 效果 |\n|------|------|\n| 私聊中断重连 | ✅ session 继续，记忆还在（.md 文件） |\n| 30天后回来 | ✅ .md 文件还在，但 session 已被 prune |\n| 切换到另一个 chat | ❌ 新 session，但 .md 共享（跨聊天记忆） |\n| 群聊 @我 | ❌ 如果是独立 session → 记忆不自动共享 |\n\n**核心限制：** 跨聊天/跨 session 共享记忆靠 .md 文件，需要我在文件里显式写入。但不同 session 启动时都会读这些文件，所以理论上只要我写了，不同 session 都能看到。\n\n**你现在缺的：** 是没有机制让群聊 session 主动去读 main 的 .md 文件——那是另一块 workspace。\n\n需要我帮你打通群聊记忆共享吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":45885,"output":438,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46323,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780326255228,"responseId":"066cd26f40013c0d60458697fd978609"}}
{"type":"message","id":"466d1a35","parentId":"04907d08","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:07:55.489Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6eee4aaaeca4c2f1d1b8e6cb0f1\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-06-01 15:07 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6eee4aaaeca4c2f1d1b8e6cb0f1]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: 群聊 session 能创建长久记忆么"}],"timestamp":1780326475448}}
{"type":"message","id":"4a6d66df","parentId":"466d1a35","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:08:05.764Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Boss is asking if group chat sessions can create persistent/long-term memory. The answer is yes, but it depends on where the group chat session's workspace is and whether it shares the same .md files as the main session.\n\nThe key issue: group chat sessions likely have different workspaces, so their .md files are separate. But if we can make them write to the same shared files, they can share memory.\n\nLet me think about what's needed for group chat sessions to have persistent memory:\n\n1. The group chat session needs to have a workspace defined\n2. That workspace needs to be the same as main (or symlinked)\n3. Or the group chat agent needs to be configured to use the same workspace\n\n\n4. Alternatively, I could use the memory_search tool to query the main session's .md files from within a group chat session\n\nSo the answer is: technically yes, but only if the workspace is configured correctly. Otherwise each session maintains its own isolated .md files.\n","thinkingSignature":"3be34b12f9b3bceb8a5279460e6ce439ca65ee12aeac9667fcfd15a4060671a1"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n能，但取决于 workspace 配置。\n\n## 群聊 session 的记忆走向\n\n群聊 session 启动时：\n- 读自己 workspace 里的 .md 文件\n- 写自己的 .md 文件\n- **不会自动读 main 的 MEMORY.md**\n\n所以如果群聊和 main 用不同 workspace → 记忆隔离，各走各的。\n\n## 打通方案\n\n**方案 1：群聊 agent 也用同一个 workspace**\n\n在 `agents.list` 里找到群聊对应的 agent，把 workspace 改成 `~/.openclaw/workspace/`。这样群聊 session 启动也会读同一套 .md 文件。\n\n**方案 2：共享记忆文件（不改 workspace）**\n\n在群聊 agent 的 workspace 里建软链接指向 main 的 MEMORY.md。但 session-memory hook 可能不支持跨 workspace 读。\n\n**方案 3：我来做中间人**\n\n群聊 session 启动时，我主动调用 `memory_search` 去查 main 的记忆文件，把相关片段注入上下文。**不需要改配置，靠我主动行为。**\n\n---\n\n你群聊里的 agent workspace 设的是哪个？查到后可以确认能不能打通。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":2952,"output":430,"cacheRead":43417,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46799,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780326475550,"responseId":"066cd34c7c10adec07da53c6acfc7cb3"}}
{"type":"message","id":"d409f4fa","parentId":"4a6d66df","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:09:42.863Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6eee45d6d4a4c3bf0ba848701ca\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-06-01 15:09 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6eee45d6d4a4c3bf0ba848701ca]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: 群聊用的是同一个agent"}],"timestamp":1780326582821}}
{"type":"message","id":"c15d9101","parentId":"d409f4fa","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:09:57.163Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying the group chat uses the same agent (main agent). So the group chat and DM are the same agent, just different sessions. The session scope determines whether they share context or not.\n\nSince it's the same agent, the workspace is the same (`~/.openclaw/workspace/`). So:\n- Same MEMORY.md\n- Same session-memory hook\n\nBut the question is whether group chat sessions and DM sessions share the same session or have separate ones. This depends on `session.scope` and `session.dmScope` / `session.groupScope`.\n\nIf `session.scope = \"per-sender\"` (which is the default), then different senders would have different sessions. \n\nFor the same sender in different chats (DM vs group), it depends on how the channel distinguishes sessions. In Feishu, a direct message and a group message from the same sender would be different conversations, so they could be different sessions.\n\nThe key issue is whether group chat sessions automatically have access to the same memory context when they start. Since it's the same agent and same workspace, the session-memory hook will read the same .md files. But session context (what's in the conversation window before the hook runs) depends on whether the session is new or reused.\n\nActually, if it's the same agent and same workspace, then:\n1. session-memory hook reads the same .md files for both DM and group chat sessions\n2. So MEMORY.md content is available to both\n3. The difference is just the live conversation context (what was said in the current session)\n\nSo both DM and group chat can access the same long-term memory through MEMORY.md, but they won't share the conversation history of each other's sessions.\n\nBut wait - the user said group chat and DM use the same agent. That means the group chat session and DM session are separate sessions, but with the same workspace. So when a new group chat session starts, it will read MEMORY.md just like the DM does. The only difference is the conversation context in the current session window.\n\nThe answer is: Yes, group chat can create lasting memory. Since it's the same agent with the same workspace, when the session starts, the session-memory hook will read the same .md files, giving it access to the same long-term memories as the DM.\n","thinkingSignature":"211162f1f162d5cb08cc46d57ae84a90ace3bf61f8b7a9634bf591f81d3be805"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n那没问题了。\n\n同一个 agent + 同一个 workspace = 群聊 session 启动时，session-memory hook 会读同一套 .md 文件。\n\n**所以：**\n- MEMORY.md → 群聊和私聊都能读到\n- memory/ 今天+昨天 → 一样\n- 我在私聊里写到 MEMORY.md 的内容 → 下次群聊启动也能看到\n\n群聊 session **可以**创建持久记忆，前提是我把内容写成文件（MEMORY.md 或 daily notes）。\n\n**唯一区别：**\nsession 上下文（对话窗口里已经聊过的内容）在群聊和私聊之间不共享，但那是短期窗口记忆，重启就没了，不影响持久层。\n\n**实际结论：**\n群聊和私聊的记忆差异只在于「谁主动写进去」。只要写了文件，两边都能用。要我把你觉得重要的信息同步到 MEMORY.md 吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":2805,"output":655,"cacheRead":43852,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47312,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780326582873,"responseId":"066cd3b7f563b5ad895b7229d75e6120"}}
