{"type":"message","id":"eed5e6e7","parentId":"36eb3c3b","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:10:23.744Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The memory_search is configured with:\n- provider: gemini\n- model: text-embedding-004\n\nBut looking at the google models configured, there's:\n- gemini-2.5-flash-lite\n- gemini-2.5-flash\n\nThere's no `text-embedding-004` model in the google provider models list. The embedding model `text-embedding-004` is not in the configured models.\n\nSo memory_search would likely fail or use a different model because the required embedding model isn't configured in the models.providers.google.models array.\n\nLet me verify this is the issue.\n","thinkingSignature":"85ef10d84986e49fc73f4801f2a96514337e055a24df253f486e34124003cb95"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n有问题。\n\n```\nmemorySearch.provider = \"gemini\"\nmemorySearch.model = \"text-embedding-004\"\n\n但 models.providers.google.models 里只有：\n- gemini-2.5-flash-lite\n- gemini-2.5-flash\n```\n\n**`text-embedding-004` 没在配置里。**\n\n这意味着 memory_search 发请求时会找不到这个模型，可能：\n1. 调用失败\n2. provider 回退到自己默认的 embedding 模型\n\n**要修复，加一行：**\n\n```json\n\"models\": {\n  \"google\": {\n    \"models\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"text-embedding-004\",\n        \"name\": \"Text Embedding 004\",\n        \"input\": [\"text\"],\n        \"contextWindow\": 30720,\n        \"maxTokens\": 30720\n      },\n      ...existing models...\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n要我直接改配置吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":2845,"output":314,"cacheRead":44647,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47806,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780326615899,"responseId":"066cd3d8f2f76b6c1cd52ac0d0534c80"}}
