{"type":"message","id":"9f918110","parentId":"89e92953","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:11:34.226Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about the `...existing models...` placeholder in the JSON snippet. They want to know what it means and what it's for.\n\nThe `...existing models...` is not actual JSON, it's a placeholder indicating \"keep the existing models that are already there.\" So the final config should include all the original models PLUS the new text-embedding-004 model.\n\nLet me clarify this.\n","thinkingSignature":"97aa97814fe6be59ebdeacf4c6b8ea0d2c89532a2b58128303f5edafdcd90e53"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n不是，`...existing models...` 是**占位符**，意思是\"把原来有的模型保留下来\"。\n\n实际写进去是这样：\n\n```json\n\"models\": {\n  \"google\": {\n    \"models\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"text-embedding-004\",\n        \"name\": \"Text Embedding 004\",\n        \"input\": [\"text\"],\n        \"contextWindow\": 30720,\n        \"maxTokens\": 30720\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"gemini-2.5-flash-lite\",\n        \"name\": \"Gemini 2.5 Flash-Lite\",\n        \"input\": [\"text\", \"image\"],\n        ...\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"gemini-2.5-flash\",\n        \"name\": \"Gemini 2.5 Flash\",\n        \"input\": [\"text\", \"image\"],\n        ...\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n新增一个，保留原来的两个。\n\n要我直接改吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":3374,"output":288,"cacheRead":44379,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":48041,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780326688219,"responseId":"066cd420e1a3ebe691a2eb8b5620f04e"}}
