{"type":"message","id":"8b559d2c","parentId":"0290c5f0","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:16:10.952Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_vgvk80jxs1dk_1","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"Google Generative Language API text-embedding-004 embedding model 2024 2025\",\n  \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 1086,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"21dc7b6add1acfe2\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nEmbeddings | Gemini API | Google AI for Developers\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"21dc7b6add1acfe2\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/embeddings\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e42a5233bf1bdffb\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe latest model , gemini- embedding -2, is the first multimodal embedding model in the Gemini API . It maps text , images, video, audio, and documents into a unified embedding space, enabling cross-modal search, classification, and clustering across over 100 languages . See the multimodal embeddings section to learn more.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e42a5233bf1bdffb\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"ai.google.dev\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f3ee1cb159c1e29e\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nText Embeddings | google-gemini/api-examples | DeepWiki\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f3ee1cb159c1e29e\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://deepwiki.com/google-gemini/api-examples/6.2-text-embeddings\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ba533f39e63d6114\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nOverview The Gemini API provides text embedding capabilities through the text-embedding-004 model , which converts text strings into high-dimensional vector representations. The embedding service supports both single text embedding and batch processing of multiple texts simultaneously.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ba533f39e63d6114\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"deepwiki.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"db074da727f2e93f\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\ntext_embedding_new_api.ipynb - Colab - Google Colab\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"db074da727f2e93f\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://colab.research.google.com/github/GoogleCloudPlatform/vertex-ai-samples/blob/main/notebooks/official/generative_ai/text_embedding_new_api.ipynb\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"778608d3c1d3c32d\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe latest model is gemini- embedding -001, a state-of-the-art model built on the Gemini backbone that supports 100+ languages as well as code. See the supported text languages and the supported language models .\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"778608d3c1d3c32d\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"colab.research.google.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f735254d33581ede\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nGemini text-embedding-004 | Embedding Model Details & Performance\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f735254d33581ede\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://agentset.ai/embeddings/gemini-text-embedding-004\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cf9e9ce9c6eb7017\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nComplete guide to Gemini text-embedding-004 by Google . View performance metrics, leaderboard position, and compare with other embedding models .\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cf9e9ce9c6eb7017\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"agentset.ai\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8b5bcfdf47a2fc34\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nGoogle: Gemini 