{"type":"message","id":"0bac86ce","parentId":"8b559d2c","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:16:17.811Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Yes, text-embedding-004 is supported by the Google/Gemini API. Now let me check the base URL and API format used in the config to make sure I add the correct model.\n\nThe base URL in the config is:\n`https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/openai`\n\nThis is the OpenAI-compatible endpoint. So the model would be used via the completions-style API.\n\nLet me verify the model name is indeed `text-embedding-004` and add it.\n","thinkingSignature":"2bb4da7deeea8f00ee92be7daeb44dbe395b26cfd312fb1a7d5181dcce4ea613"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n支持。`text-embedding-004` 是 Gemini API 的标准 embedding 模型。\n\n你的 base URL 是 `generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/openai`，走的是 OpenAI-compat 格式，可以直接加。\n\n加一下：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_5zki9xygcebd_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat /home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json | python3 -c \"\nimport json, sys\nd = json.load(sys.stdin)\n\ngoogle = d['models']['providers']['google']\n# 检查是否已有\nhas_embedding = any(m['id'] == 'text-embedding-004' for m in google['models'])\nprint('text-embedding-004 already exists:', has_embedding)\nprint('current models:', [m['id'] for m in google['models']])\n\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":3572,"output":274,"cacheRead":45718,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":49564,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780326970954,"responseId":"066cd53b19d833103e69fb15f049ee3f"}}
