{"type":"message","id":"ff4d6845","parentId":"5f33561d","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:16:27.841Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Google API does support text-embedding-004. I found that:\n1. Multiple sources confirm Google Gemini API supports text-embedding-004\n2. The model converts text into high-dimensional vector representations\n3. It supports batch processing as well\n\nNow I should add it to the config. Let me do the edit.\n","thinkingSignature":"dc661de61f2afccd1ed9221694bc8e208a2360b58bffec8c107b12fbb5105d44"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n支持。Google Gemini API 文档明确有 `text-embedding-004`，而且还提到了更新的 `gemini-embedding-001`。\n\n现在加进去：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_wc0tsmhzp3y4_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"edits":[{"newText":"\"models\": [\n              {\n                \"id\": \"text-embedding-004\",\n                \"name\": \"Text Embedding 004\",\n                \"input\": [\"text\"],\n                \"contextWindow\": 30720,\n                \"maxTokens\": 30720\n              },\n              {\n                \"id\": \"gemini-2.5-flash-lite\",","oldText":"\"models\": [\n              {\n                \"id\": \"gemini-2.5-flash-lite\","}],"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":2470,"output":262,"cacheRead":46990,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":49722,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780326977998,"responseId":"066cd54254417f8b51b900126f97d136"}}
