{"type":"message","id":"cbaf6ed6","parentId":"28535155","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:16:55.512Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The edit worked this time - no error. The text-embedding-004 model was added to the google provider's models list. The user asked if the API supports it, I confirmed it does, and I made the change. Now I should let the user know it's done and that it requires a restart to take effect.\n","thinkingSignature":"40d7bd5b477fb75be2cd5e2d22d7d7bc07c4b1c28dd070212c027d8ba3c35ee9"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n加了。确认 API 支持（Google Gemini API 确实有 text-embedding-004），配置已更新：\n\n```json\n\"models\": {\n  \"google\": {\n    \"models\": [\n      \"text-embedding-004\",  // ✅ 新增\n      \"gemini-2.5-flash-lite\",\n      \"gemini-2.5-flash\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**需要 restart 才能生效。** 要现在重启吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":2742,"output":163,"cacheRead":48693,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":51598,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780327009625,"responseId":"066cd56229ca9b1a1b9381af4061959b"}}
