{"type":"message","id":"6f646b95","parentId":"295bb151","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:19:55.680Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about why they're getting an \"edit failed\" message. This seems to be related to the interactive card that was sent in reply to their message. \n\nLooking at the reply context, it shows:\n- `reply_to_id: om_x100b6eee684644a4c2ecccab95146c3` \n- The message being replied to is `[Interactive Card]`\n- `has_reply_context: true`\n\nSo the user is replying to an interactive card (probably the one I sent earlier asking if they want to restart). The edit failure might be because they're interacting with a card that doesn't support the edit action, or the card was already processed.\n\n\nI see now that the user is asking about the \"观念edit失败\" message—they're referring to the error notification that appeared when they tried to interact with the card. Since they were replying to the interactive card I sent asking about a restart, their response probably triggered an edit action that failed because interactive cards don't support that kind of modification.\n","thinkingSignature":"504b8b75ca920f211994444aab78a87d5548407414e6b63bd0931875dda50221"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n哪个环节出现的？\n\n是你**回复那张\"是否重启\"的交互卡片**时失败了，还是别的地方？\n\n可能的原因：\n1. 飞书卡片不支持直接回复编辑（卡片消息是独立的，不能像普通文字那样 edit）\n2. 卡片过期了\n3. 操作时序问题（卡片已经处理过了）\n\n把报错截图或完整消息发一下，我看看是哪个环节。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":6237,"output":288,"cacheRead":45297,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":51822,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780327187267,"responseId":"066cd613eb464519e168d9f90c34aeb7"}}
