{"type":"message","id":"4ba22ffa","parentId":"b551c101","timestamp":"2026-06-01T17:32:39.478Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Key findings from the logs:\n\n1. The most recent log entries show that after May 28 (when the custor agent was added), there were config validation issues:\n   - `valid: false` with `suspicious: [\"missing-meta-vs-last-good\",\"gateway-mode-missing-vs-last-good\"]`\n   - This means the config was missing `meta` section and `gatewayMode`\n\n2. After that, I don't see any more recent log entries - so the gateway may have been restarted or the logging stopped.\n\n3. Now it's June 1 and there's a session file from 17:29 that was active until 17:31 (the fabd509d session).\n   \nLooking at the config file, the `lastTouchedVersion` is set to 2026.5.19, which is odd since the config write on May 28 with the custor agent should have updated it. But I notice the current file is missing the `meta` section entirely - it was there before but now it's gone. That missing `meta` is what's triggering the validation error.\n\nThe suspicious flags about `gatewayMode` missing make sense now too. It seems like something overwrote the config file around May 28-30, reverting it to an older state without the `meta` information that was there before.\n\nBut since the gateway is running fine right now and the health endpoint works, the current config must be valid enough to operate. I should check if there's a newer session file for the group chat issue since this direct message session started more recently.\n","thinkingSignature":"dc02c135b367ef3ba127d6133da6c24c2343f648f687fe7a4fd2e599f89cfab5"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_062cwkk8wbsg_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la /home/node/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/ | grep -v \"trajectory\\|deleted\" | sort -k6,7 | tail -15","timeout":5}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":9921,"output":388,"cacheRead":64920,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":75229,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780335149923,"responseId":"066cf52e6889ba16548ea327e34855ae"}}
