{"type":"message","id":"95f237aa","parentId":"d3482d64","timestamp":"2026-06-01T17:33:18.677Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The stability log shows an old startup failure from May 23 - that's old, not relevant now. The current gateway is running fine.\n\nThe current session fabd509d is actively running (it's MY session - the DM session we're in right now). The user is saying \"openclaw群聊消息卡死了\" - meaning the GROUP CHAT messages are stuck/dead.\n\nLet me check the group chat sessions to understand the situation better. The key session is likely d197434d (updated at 17:15) or the group session that corresponds to the Robot Space group.\n\nLet me check what sessions look like and specifically look at the group chat session.\n","thinkingSignature":"a61fb122d8772b29ac47246bb1837a24228945628cd2bf22cb2edde1f5f95f10"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_yy5nxjni64gz_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat /home/node/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/d197434d-35fb-44bc-bc58-fc44042c8652.jsonl | python3 -c \"\nimport sys, json\nlines = sys.stdin.readlines()\nprint(f'Total entries: {len(lines)}')\n# Show first and last entry timestamps\nif lines:\n    first = json.loads(lines[0])\n    last = json.loads(lines[-1])\n    print(f'First: {first.get(\\\"timestamp\\\",\\\"?\\\")} - {str(first.get(\\\"message\\\",{}).get(\\\"content\\\",\\\"\\\"))[:80]}')\n    print(f'Last: {last.get(\\\"timestamp\\\",\\\"?\\\")} - {str(last.get(\\\"message\\\",{}).get(\\\"content\\\",\\\"\\\"))[:80]}')\n\"","timeout":5}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":4070,"output":336,"cacheRead":75951,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":80357,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780335190312,"responseId":"066cf557806f598948a568043d532822"}}
