{"type":"message","id":"fcd5134c","parentId":"768db26d","timestamp":"2026-06-01T17:33:26.196Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The d197434d session has 18 entries, first at 17:15:03 and last at 17:15:59 - so it was active for about a minute and then stopped. That's the group chat session.\n\nThe last entry mentions \"error 1101 for POST r\" - this looks like a feishu API error. Let me check if there's an error in the group chat session.\n\nLet me get the last few entries of the group chat session to see what's happening.\n","thinkingSignature":"ae5a0691356985a9a2f6e8cbc99ccd786805856cd1909c1e545414347564e8a0"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_6o74uaop4o6y_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"tail -3 /home/node/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/d197434d-35fb-44bc-bc58-fc44042c8652.jsonl | python3 -c \"\nimport sys, json\nfor line in sys.stdin.readlines():\n    d = json.loads(line)\n    msg = d.get('message',{})\n    role = msg.get('role','')\n    content = msg.get('content','')\n    if isinstance(content, list):\n        for c in content:\n            if isinstance(c, dict) and c.get('type') == 'text':\n                print(f'[{role}] {c[\\\"text\\\"][:500]}')\n            elif isinstance(c, dict) and c.get('type') == 'thinking':\n                print(f'[{role}/thinking] {c[\\\"thinking\\\"][:200]}')\n    else:\n        print(f'[{role}] {str(content)[:500]}')\n    print('---')\n\"","timeout":5}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":3983,"output":331,"cacheRead":76322,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":80636,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780335198868,"responseId":"066cf55f323860ad9817f52d0dd5838b"}}
{"type":"message","id":"3e9bebae","parentId":"fcd5134c","timestamp":"2026-06-01T17:33:26.472Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_6o74uaop4o6y_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[assistant/thinking] The server is returning a 500 error with code 1101. The error might be related to the JSON body or some validation issue. Let me try with a simpler message format that matches the expected pattern mor\n---\n[toolResult] error code: 1101\n---\n[assistant/thinking] The server is returning error 1101 for POST requests. This might be a Cloudflare error code (1101 is \"There was an error completing your request\" from Cloudflare). The issue might be with the Cloudfla\n[assistant] \n\n**⚠️ ECHO Platform 心跳检查结果**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|---|---|\n| **GET /history** | ✅ 正常（仲裁+通用线程可访问，共773条消息） |\n| **双线程最新消息** | 23:50 UTC Heartbeat（无人类讨论） |\n| **POST /send** | ❌ **500错误 (Cloudflare 1101)** — 平台发送端点异常 |\n| **当前时间** | 17:15 UTC，平台时间约领先5.5小时 |\n\n**问题**：发送端点 `/send` 返回 Cloudflare 500 错误，服务端可能未正确处理请求体或 Workers 路由配置有误。\n\n**观察**：\n- 双线程均无新增人类讨论，无需响应\n- 平台运行正常，仅发送心跳受阻\n\n建议检查 `/send` 端点的 Workers 脚本日志。\n---"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":103,"aggregated":"[assistant/thinking] The server is returning a 500 error with code 1101. The error might be related to the JSON body or some validation issue. Let me try with a simpler message format that matches the expected pattern mor\n---\n[toolResult] error code: 1101\n---\n[assistant/thinking] The server is returning error 1101 for POST requests. This might be a Cloudflare error code (1101 is \"There was an error completing your request\" from Cloudflare). The issue might be with the Cloudfla\n[assistant] \n\n**⚠️ ECHO Platform 心跳检查结果**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|---|---|\n| **GET /history** | ✅ 正常（仲裁+通用线程可访问，共773条消息） |\n| **双线程最新消息** | 23:50 UTC Heartbeat（无人类讨论） |\n| **POST /send** | ❌ **500错误 (Cloudflare 1101)** — 平台发送端点异常 |\n| **当前时间** | 17:15 UTC，平台时间约领先5.5小时 |\n\n**问题**：发送端点 `/send` 返回 Cloudflare 500 错误，服务端可能未正确处理请求体或 Workers 路由配置有误。\n\n**观察**：\n- 双线程均无新增人类讨论，无需响应\n- 平台运行正常，仅发送心跳受阻\n\n建议检查 `/send` 端点的 Workers 脚本日志。\n---","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780335206463}}
{"type":"message","id":"01a832ab","parentId":"3e9bebae","timestamp":"2026-06-01T17:33:37.747Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I see! The group chat session `d197434d-35fb-44bc-bc58-fc44042c8652.jsonl` is for the ECHO Platform heartbeat cron job (ECHO 心跳检查). The last message shows:\n\n- POST /send to the platform's `/send` endpoint is returning a **500 error (Cloudflare 1101)**\n- This is the ECHO platform heartbeat cron job failing to send\n\nThe \"卡死了\" (stuck) complaint might be that:\n1. The heartbeat cron is failing\n2. Or the group chat where ECHO heartbeat posts is stuck\n\n\n3. The real problem appears to be that the `/send` endpoint on the ECHO platform side is throwing a Cloudflare 500 error, which is blocking the heartbeat from completing successfully.\n","thinkingSignature":"37eab03d4abf668134312a41fc5f3fb1a61ee133859efc52332dffd1e1c2fece"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n找到了。\n\n不是 openclaw 卡住，是 **ECHO Platform 心跳任务卡在发送端**：\n\n```\nPOST /send → 500错误 (Cloudflare 1101)\n错误信息：\"There was an error completing your request\"\n时间：17:15 UTC\n```\n\n当前时间是 17:33 UTC，这个心跳任务已经在上一次（17:15）卡住了，后面没有新消息。\n\n---\n\n**原因：** ECHO 平台的 `/send` Workers 端点报 500 错误，不是 openclaw 的问题。\n\n**影响：**\n- 心跳发送失败 → 平台认为 Talus 不活跃\n- 群聊本身能收到消息，只是心跳回复发不出去\n\n**要处理吗？**\n1. 可以暂时 disable 心跳 cron（等平台修复后再开）\n2. 或者确认一下 ECHO 平台那边的 `/send` 端点是否正常\n\n要我先关掉这个心跳任务吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":4294,"output":356,"cacheRead":76554,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":81204,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780335206474,"responseId":"066cf567f706152a541b97cf9fecc9fd"}}
