{"type":"message","id":"648b5426","parentId":"043e419c","timestamp":"2026-06-01T18:00:28.971Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_sf6u7lppr6ys_1","toolName":"gateway","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"result\": {\n    \"path\": \"session.typingMode\",\n    \"schema\": {\n      \"title\": \"Session Typing Mode\",\n      \"description\": \"Controls typing behavior timing: \\\"never\\\", \\\"instant\\\", \\\"thinking\\\", or \\\"message\\\" based emission points. Keep conservative modes in high-volume channels to avoid unnecessary typing noise.\",\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"const\": \"never\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"const\": \"instant\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"const\": \"thinking\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"const\": \"message\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"reloadKind\": \"none\",\n    \"hint\": {\n      \"label\": \"Session Typing Mode\",\n      \"help\": \"Controls typing behavior timing: \\\"never\\\", \\\"instant\\\", \\\"thinking\\\", or \\\"message\\\" based emission points. Keep conservative modes in high-volume channels to avoid unnecessary typing noise.\",\n      \"tags\": [\n        \"storage\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"hintPath\": \"session.typingMode\",\n    \"children\": []\n  }\n}"}],"details":{"ok":true,"result":{"path":"session.typingMode","schema":{"title":"Session Typing Mode","description":"Controls typing behavior timing: \"never\", \"instant\", \"thinking\", or \"message\" based emission points. Keep conservative modes in high-volume channels to avoid unnecessary typing noise.","anyOf":[{"type":"string","const":"never"},{"type":"string","const":"instant"},{"type":"string","const":"thinking"},{"type":"string","const":"message"}]},"reloadKind":"none","hint":{"label":"Session Typing Mode","help":"Controls typing behavior timing: \"never\", \"instant\", \"thinking\", or \"message\" based emission points. Keep conservative modes in high-volume channels to avoid unnecessary typing noise.","tags":["storage"]},"hintPath":"session.typingMode","children":[]}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780336828960}}
{"type":"message","id":"69d00fca","parentId":"648b5426","timestamp":"2026-06-01T18:00:35.985Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The typing indicator is controlled by `session.typingMode`. The current config has it set to `\"natural\"` (which is one of the modes mentioned in the config we saw earlier). But `\"natural\"` isn't in the schema list. Let me check what's actually configured.\n\nFrom the earlier config dump, I saw:\n```json\n\"typingMode\": {\n  \"mode\": \"natural\"\n}\n```\n\nBut the schema only lists: \"never\", \"instant\", \"thinking\", \"message\". \"natural\" might be a legacy value.\n\nSo the typing indicator (敲键盘状态) is controlled by `session.typingMode` and the current setting is `natural`.\n","thinkingSignature":"958002179a080dd93a969058f9d09f2afe3fa33a6a75376f41c335c9b52a4214"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n`session.typingMode` 控制的。\n\n你当前的配置：\n\n```json\n\"typingMode\": {\n  \"mode\": \"natural\"\n}\n```\n\n**可选值：**\n- `never` — 完全不显示敲键盘\n- `instant` — 立即显示\n- `thinking` — 思考时显示\n- `message` — 收到首字就显示\n\n`natural` 是上一个版本的写法，现在新版可能已经改名。看截图里那个敲键盘状态还在，说明 `typingMode` 是开着的。\n\n要关掉的话，改成：\n\n```json\n\"typingMode\": \"never\"\n```\n\n要试试吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":4173,"output":264,"cacheRead":79070,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":83507,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780336828973,"responseId":"066cfbbd6edeee161f76adb437396545"}}
