{"type":"message","id":"989fa79b","parentId":"839a8e0b","timestamp":"2026-06-01T18:34:13.080Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking whether thinking mode (reasoning) applies to all chats, or if it can be configured separately for DM vs group chats.\n\nLet me check the thinking/reasoning configuration. Looking at the current model config:\n\n```json\n\"model\": {\n  \"primary\": \"minimax-portal/MiniMax-M2.7\",\n  \"fallbacks\": [...]\n}\n```\n\nAnd the model config for MiniMax M2.7 has `reasoning: true` in the provider config.\n\nBut the user is asking about `thinking` mode specifically - which is a separate concept. Let me check if there's a session-level or per-chat-type thinking configuration.\n\nLooking at the schema paths I've seen:\n- `session.thinking` - not sure if it exists\n- `agents.defaults.model` - has reasoning settings\n- `runtime.reasoning` - might be a thing\n\nLet me check the schema for thinking-related config.\n","thinkingSignature":"7b605a82a05119b587ed49eb44f13cbc55751e8ea07229a58a94bd49a7d9a78c"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_888fpfm1zpiu_1","name":"gateway","arguments":{"action":"config.schema.lookup","path":"session.thinking"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":82662,"output":229,"cacheRead":109,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":83000,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780338842221,"responseId":"066d039b5a337e488ae245a2debe1d8d"}}
