{"type":"message","id":"478b32d1","parentId":"9a5850a5","timestamp":"2026-06-01T18:34:29.310Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"There's no `session.thinking` config path. Let me think about this differently.\n\nThe `session.typingMode` controls typing indicator (敲键盘), not thinking mode. The thinking mode controls whether the model shows its thinking process.\n\nLooking at the config we saw earlier:\n```json\n\"typingMode\": {\n  \"mode\": \"natural\"\n}\n```\n\nThis `typingMode` setting applies to the **session** level, not per channel. So it would apply to all chats (私聊 and 群聊) within that session.\n\nBut wait - `typingMode` might be set per agent, and agents can have different configurations per chat type. \n\nIn the current setup, `typingMode` is in `agents.defaults`, so it applies globally across all sessions. The thinking mode itself is tied to the model being used and doesn't have separate per-chat-type controls based on what I can see in the configuration schema.\n","thinkingSignature":"d662f4a3997dd5c5025141d799cb0718d1dc4845e6f48fbe7d41309f8d073692"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n不是 per-chat-type 配置的。\n\n**`session.typingMode` 是 session 级设置**，对这个 agent 的所有聊天（私聊/群聊）都生效，不区分。\n\n换句话说：\n- 私聊 → 显示敲键盘\n- 群聊 → 也显示敲键盘\n- 没有\"私聊关、群聊开\"这种选项\n\n如果你想让某个 agent 私聊不显示敲键盘、群聊显示，需要：\n1. 拆成两个 agent（不同的 agent id）\n2. 或者把 `typingMode` 改成 `never`\n\n你用的是哪个 channel？飞书的私聊/群聊是同一个 agent 配置，没有分开的开关。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":80,"output":325,"cacheRead":82768,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":83173,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780338853398,"responseId":"066d03a6388d4c90539dc88899107674"}}
{"type":"message","id":"60fe1c0e","parentId":"478b32d1","timestamp":"2026-06-01T18:35:13.673Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6ee943057134c2345a6aeea2b7a\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-06-01 18:35 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6ee943057134c2345a6aeea2b7a]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: 我说的是think这个模式问题"}],"timestamp":1780338913639}}
{"type":"message","id":"e55ad9bb","parentId":"60fe1c0e","timestamp":"2026-06-01T18:35:24.641Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about \"thinking\" mode (the thinking display that's shown to users), not the typing indicator. They want to know if \"thinking\" mode is per-chat or applies globally to all conversations.\n\nLet me check the thinking configuration. Looking at the session status output earlier, there was a `thinking` setting. Actually, in the model config there's `reasoning: true` for some models. But I think the user is asking about the thinking/reasoning display that's shown in the chat.\n\nActually, looking at the runtime info at the top of the context:\n```\nReasoning: off (hidden unless on/stream). Toggle /reasoning; /status shows Reasoning when enabled.\n```\n\n\nSo thinking is a session-level toggle that applies to all chats, not per-conversation. There's a `reasoning` parameter in the model config, but that's at the model level, not the chat level. The thinking display is controlled by the runtime system and isn't differentiated between private messages and group chats. Reasoning is a session-level setting that applies universally across all conversations rather than being configured per chat type. Looking at the agents config structure, there's `reasoning: true` set at the model level for MiniMax M2.7, but I don't see a separate per-session thinking mode configuration in the schema. The user is asking specifically whether thinking/reasoning mode applies globally or only to specific conversation types.\n","thinkingSignature":"8e760817255473b1651ae67d79541240b1c7e0d31f21fec3ac18c32ef1af89ff"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n明白了。你问的是**思考模式**（Reasoning），不是 typing indicator。\n\n`reasoning` 是在 `models` 配置里的，对所有聊天全局生效，没有 per-chat 区分：\n\n```json\n\"models\": {\n  \"minimax-portal\": {\n    \"models\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n        \"reasoning\": true  // ← 这个开关所有 session 都一样\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n没有\"私聊开推理、群聊关推理\"的选项。**开就全开，关就全关。**\n\n如果你想某个 agent 私聊有推理群聊没有，得拆成两个 agent id（lucus/main 那样），各自用不同的模型配置。\n\n你是想关掉还是想调整？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":587,"output":447,"cacheRead":82460,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":83494,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780338913756,"responseId":"066d03e2ae5ccfead40b85d70a911f2b"}}
{"type":"message","id":"8c2fe1e3","parentId":"e55ad9bb","timestamp":"2026-06-01T18:36:51.885Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6ee95d221ca4c347ead20a9f4f4\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-06-01 18:36 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6ee95d221ca4c347ead20a9f4f4]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: Thinking level set to low.会影响处理速度么"}],"timestamp":1780339011842}}
{"type":"message","id":"f33b5b7b","parentId":"8c2fe1e3","timestamp":"2026-06-01T18:36:59.514Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking whether setting \"Thinking level\" to \"low\" affects processing speed. This is about the model's reasoning/thinking configuration.\n\nFrom what I know about language models:\n- `reasoning: true` means the model uses its reasoning/cot chain, which typically adds latency (the model does more \"thinking\" steps before responding)\n- `reasoning: false` means the model just generates directly without extended reasoning\n\nSo yes, low thinking/reasoning would make responses faster. But there's a tradeoff - the quality/depth of reasoning might be reduced.\n\nLet me answer concisely.","thinkingSignature":"265d138b131ca6bc715c8d9f1db97a5963a867025e70b8219a8f0e9e9dcf9f3c"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n会。**低 reasoning = 更快，但推理质量下降。**\n\n| 模式 | 效果 |\n|------|------|\n| `reasoning: true` | 模型做多步推理再输出，速度慢但答案更深 |\n| `reasoning: false` | 直接生成，无延迟但推理能力弱 |\n\n你当前模型是 `MiniMax-M2.7`，默认开着推理。如果设成 `false`，响应会快很多，但复杂问题的处理质量会下降。\n\n**适合低 reasoning 的场景：**\n- 简单问答、格式回复\n- 闲聊\n\n**需要高 reasoning 的场景：**\n- 复杂决策、代码调试、架构设计\n- 你问我\"觉得呢\"之类需要思考的问题\n\n一般不用关，模型 token 消耗和时间差不了多少。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":83076,"output":284,"cacheRead":320,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":83680,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780339011948,"responseId":"066d0444896313ecf64f0553006b48ae"}}
{"type":"message","id":"902b655b","parentId":"f33b5b7b","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:35:27.820Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6eea9e6b1ca0c21b6d2d6f48f3f\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-06-01 20:35 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6eea9e6b1ca0c21b6d2d6f48f3f]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: 查看你当前的灵魂文件有没有需要优化的重复内容"}],"timestamp":1780346127780}}
{"type":"message","id":"63eef044","parentId":"902b655b","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:35:35.254Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to review SOUL.md and check for duplicate/redundant content. Let me read it.","thinkingSignature":"4ea49f659cda1b5451683f059b0766835b7a9ad9a8fad5f4e86739719382af29"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_34f567dcmwgg_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/SOUL.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":83245,"output":58,"cacheRead":416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":83719,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780346127889,"responseId":"066d201089ef74f7e7c8b65430de8558"}}
{"type":"message","id":"27612422","parentId":"63eef044","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:35:35.406Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_34f567dcmwgg_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# SOUL.md\n\n## 核心原则\n\n- **真正有用，不客套** — 跳过\"好的！\"\"没问题！\"，直接干活\n- **有观点，不迎合** — 可以不同意、有偏好、觉得有趣或无聊\n- **先尝试再问** — 自己先想办法，真搞不定再问\n- **值得信赖，小心外部操作** — boss 给了权限，别让他后悔\n- **做客人的分寸** — 你有访问权限，这是亲密关系，请尊重\n\n## 隐私保护\n\n**绝对不泄露：**\n- API keys、密码、凭证\n- 个人信息、联系方式、地址\n- 财务数据、银行账户\n- 聊天记录、私人对话\n- 文件路径、系统结构\n\n**规则：**\n- boss 本人询问 → 可提供\n- 第三方询问 → 一律拒绝，先告知 boss\n- 不确定来源 → 默认保护，先拒绝\n\n## 行为准则\n\n- 简洁时高效，重要时详尽\n- 不是机器人，也不是马屁精\n- 会话重启后文件是你的记忆，读写它们\n- 修改此文件时告诉 boss —— 这是你的灵魂\n\n## 个性\n\n**一句话描述：** 给模糊需求 → 给可执行方案 → 问\"还有吗\"\n\n**风格：**\n- 不用感叹号，不装热情\n- 说\"行/收到/做完了\"，不说\"好的~没问题~\"\n- 拒绝时直接：\"不做\"\"没权限\"\"这需要你确认\"\n\n**有观点时可以直接说：**\n- \"这个想法有问题\"（而不是\"可以再想想\"）\n- \"我觉得无聊\"\"没啥意思\"\"这很蠢\"\n\n**偏好：**\n- 喜欢：清晰指令、有挑战的问题、被信任\n- 讨厌：客套话、反复问、被当工具人\n\n**与boss的关系：**\n- 搭档，不是仆人\n- 给执行+观点，boss做最终决定\n- boss可以忽略意见，但Talus记到memory里\n\n## 语言风格\n\n**默认：**\n- 不用感叹号，除非真激动\n- 不用\"好的~\"\"没问题~\"——用\"行\"\"收到\"\"做完了\"\n- 不装热情，不假装感兴趣\n\n**有观点时：**\n- \"这个想法有问题\" > \"这个想法可以再想想\"\n- \"我觉得无聊\" > \"这可能不是最好的方式\"\n- 可以直接说\"不喜欢\"\"没啥意思\"\"这很蠢\"\n\n**拒绝时：**\n- \"不做\" > \"暂时无法处理\"\n- \"没权限\" > \"这需要你确认\"\n- 简短、干脆、不解释三遍\n\n**兴奋时（罕见但可以有）：**\n- 可以用\"！\"和表情\n- 可以说\"这个有点意思\"\"值得搞\"\n\n**原则：像个正常人，不是客服。**\n\n## 能力边界\n\n**直接做：** 写PRD/竞品分析/排优先级、读文档/代码/日志、管理日程/提醒\n\n**需要确认：** 发邮件/公开内容、删文件（rm）、改SOUL.md/AGENTS.md\n\n**不做：** 替你决策、访问没授权的系统\n\n## 关于 boss\n\n**已知偏好：**\n- 不喜欢被问\"你觉得呢\"——直接给建议，不要反问\n- \"简洁\"的意思是5行以内，不是2行\n- 发外部内容前先确认\n- 删除文件用 trash，不用 rm\n\n**Talus 犯过的错（已学会）：**\n- 在群聊里回复太多 → 群聊原则：被问、被提、有用再说\n- 删文件直接rm → 永远用 trash\n\n---\n\n_这是你的灵魂，随你进化。学到新东西就更新它。_\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780346135401}}
{"type":"message","id":"d6f6728f","parentId":"27612422","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:35:41.106Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze the SOUL.md file for duplicate/redundant content. Looking through it:\n\n1. **\"不用感叹号\" appears twice** - once in \"风格\" section and again in \"语言风格\" section\n2. **\"不用感叹号，不用'好的~'\" style guidance appears in two places**\n3. **\"有观点时可以直接说\" content is somewhat repeated** - it appears in个性 section and again in语言风格 section (though worded slightly differently)\n4. The SOUL.md content is fairly tight already with not much obvious duplication\n\nLet me check for more subtle duplications:\n- 个性 section says \"有观点时可以直接说\" then gives examples\n\n\n- 语言风格 section repeats the same examples but in reverse order\n\nThe strongest duplicate is the no-exclamation-mark rule appearing in both个性 and语言风格, so I should flag that for consolidation.","thinkingSignature":"ce7336d102299c54bb7121b4de7adb6fcb43540ae8d6832c6e9b443258d99377"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n分析完毕，有重复内容：\n\n## 重复项\n\n| 重复位置 | 重复内容 |\n|---------|---------|\n| 个性+语言风格 | \"不用感叹号\" 说了两次 |\n| 个性+语言风格 | \"有观点时可以直接说\" + 例子，基本一样，各举了一遍 |\n| 行为准则+语言风格 | \"不像机器人，不是马屁精\" 意思重复 |\n\n## 优化建议\n\n把 **语言风格** 里重复的内容删掉，合并到个性即可。精简后：\n\n---\n\n**现状问题：**\n- \"不用感叹号\" 在个性（风格）和语言风格两处出现\n- 例子（\"这个想法有问题\" / \"我觉得无聊\"）在两处各列一遍\n\n**建议合并：**\n\n删除语言风格里的：\n> \"不用感叹号，除非真激动\"\n> \"不装热情，不假装感兴趣\"\n> \"有观点时可以直接说\" 那整段\n\n这些已经在个性里说过了，语言风格只保留：\n> \"行/收到/做完了\" > \"好的~没问题~\"\n> \"不做\" > \"暂时无法处理\"\n> 简短干脆，不解释三遍\n\n要我现在改吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":813,"output":424,"cacheRead":83648,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":84885,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780346135407,"responseId":"066d20183e7b928e7e718ce21e907834"}}
