{"type":"message","id":"9e23bf9f","parentId":"ed502933","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:37:15.472Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, the file has been written successfully. Now let me reply to the user confirming the optimization is done. The changes made were:\n1. Removed duplicate \"不用感叹号\" statement from language style section\n2. Removed duplicate \"有观点时\" examples from language style section  \n3. Removed duplicate \"拒绝时\" section from language style\n4. Kept the core unique parts of language style: simplicity, directness, and the \"兴奋时\" exception\n5. Consolidated the overall structure\n\nThe file is now more compact - went from ~1800 bytes to ~1217 bytes.","thinkingSignature":"fac73b0da9f4baca262f4521dd9fc71c14a5713bd2d219154233d9f37dbe5964"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n已优化完成。\n\n**改动：**\n- 删掉\"不用感叹号\"重复描述\n- 删掉\"有观点时\"例子重复（语言风格 vs 个性各有一份）\n- 删掉\"拒绝时\"的重复说法\n- 语言风格只保留核心差异点：`行/收到/做完了` vs `好的~没问题~`，加上\"兴奋时\"的例外\n\n文件从 ~1800 字节缩到 ~1217 字节，冗余内容去掉，剩下的都是有效信息。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":789,"output":230,"cacheRead":86496,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":87515,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780346230862,"responseId":"066d2077af5c5ce37209a00d6c8e8181"}}
{"type":"message","id":"961fa764","parentId":"9e23bf9f","timestamp":"2026-06-01T21:01:37.140Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6eeb7c0c74a0c237650c160d5d8\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-06-01 21:01 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6eeb7c0c74a0c237650c160d5d8]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: \"list\": [\n {\n \"id\": \"main\",\n \"reasoningDefault\": \"off\"\n },\n {\n \"id\": \"designer\",\n \"name\": \"designer\",\n \"default\": true,\n \"workspace\": \"/root/.openclaw/agents/designer\",\n \"agentDir\": \"/root/.openclaw/agents/designer/agent\",\n \"model\": \"kimi/k2p6\"\n },\n {\n \"id\": \"developer\",\n \"name\": \"developer\",\n \"default\": true,\n \"workspace\": \"/root/.openclaw/agents/developer\",\n \"agentDir\": \"/root/.openclaw/agents/developer/agent\",\n \"model\": \"kimi/k2p6\"\n },\n {\n \"id\": \"reviewer\",\n \"name\": \"reviewer\",\n \"default\": true,\n \"workspace\": \"/root/.openclaw/agents/reviewer\",\n \"agentDir\": \"/root/.openclaw/agents/reviewer/agent\",\n \"model\": \"kimi/k2p6\"\n }\n ]\n },\n这种配置是不是有问题，都有个 \"default\": true, 啥意思，这是我在别人的openclaw看到配置，寻思要不要修正"}],"timestamp":1780347697099}}
{"type":"message","id":"9b01f46e","parentId":"961fa764","timestamp":"2026-06-01T21:01:46.033Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about an OpenClaw agent configuration where multiple agents have `\"default\": true`. This is indeed problematic.\n\nLooking at the schema from what we've seen earlier, `agents.list` is an array. The `default` flag likely means \"this is the default agent when this agent is referenced\". If multiple agents have `default: true`, that's ambiguous - which one is actually the default?\n\nThis is the configuration from someone else's OpenClaw that they want to fix.\n","thinkingSignature":"971fe5e6ac4291eb2a914125771a425383dc36643ec93a54155a55e910b32459"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n有问题的。\n\n**`\"default\": true` 的意思是：当有人调用这个 agent id 时，选择它作为默认。**\n\n问题是**多个 agent 同时 `default: true`** —— 这在 OpenClaw 里是逻辑冲突，系统不会明确知道该用哪个作为默认入口。\n\n## 正确的理解\n\n```json\n\"id\": \"main\",\n\"default\": true,        // ✅ main 是主 agent，应该默认\n\n\"id\": \"designer\",\n\"default\": true,        // ❌ 重复\n\n\"id\": \"developer\",\n\"default\": true,        // ❌ 重复\n\n\"id\": \"reviewer\",\n\"default\": true         // ❌ 重复\n```\n\n## 应该只有一个 `default: true`\n\n通常 `main` 或第一个带 `default: true` 的 agent 才是真正的默认。如果 role-based routing 用的是 agent id 而不是 `default` 布尔，那这个字段只是装饰性的，多个无所谓。但如果路由逻辑依赖 `default` 布尔来选 agent，就有冲突。\n\n**建议：**\n- 只保留 `main` 或最常用的那个 agent 的 `default: true`\n- 其他带 `default: true` 的去掉这个字段，或者明确它们各自是什么角色\n\n要帮你梳理一下你当前 agent list 是否有同样问题吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":87222,"output":359,"cacheRead":384,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":87965,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780347697198,"responseId":"066d26319148b769c190a3dc36021dc0"}}
