{"type":"message","id":"3449ef5f","parentId":"6e541f07","timestamp":"2026-06-02T02:13:00.028Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The config doesn't have `typingMode` set. It means the default is being used. But what is the default? Let me check what the actual default is for `typingMode`. From the schema I saw earlier: `\"never\"`, `\"instant\"`, `\"thinking\"`, or `\"message\"`. If not set, it probably defaults to something. Let me check the config more carefully to see if there's a `humanDelay` setting or something similar.\n\nActually, looking at the config I pulled earlier, there was a `humanDelay: { \"mode\": \"natural\" }` in agents.defaults. But `typingMode` wasn't in the session section at all. \n\nSo the typing indicator behavior is probably controlled by a global default in the code rather than through config—`session.typingMode` just doesn't exist here, which is why it returns `\"不存在\"`. The `humanDelay.mode: \"natural\"` might be what determines how typing indicators are actually delivered.\n","thinkingSignature":"de089822a57fe05c1241e0c7af5d50c157b19cb1dd795ea25478d05d821ab7d3"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n`session.typingMode` 没在配置里——**用的默认值**。\n\n从 schema 来看，可选值有：\n\n| 值 | 效果 |\n|---|---|\n| `never` | 完全不显示敲键盘 |\n| `instant` | 立即显示 |\n| `thinking` | 思考时显示 |\n| `message` | 收到首字就显示 |\n\n你的配置里没定义 `typingMode`，所以走的是 OpenClaw 的**全局默认值**，应该是 `instant` 或 `thinking`。\n\n如果想让敲键盘一直显示，改成：\n\n```json\n\"session\": {\n  \"typingMode\": \"instant\"\n}\n```\n\n要加吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":131,"output":334,"cacheRead":87904,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":88369,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780366373906,"responseId":"066d6f2692d9f5df095198c465d8532c"}}
