{"type":"message","id":"f90362f8","parentId":"9a89e34a","timestamp":"2026-06-02T02:16:54.940Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_7p5pp3f2zu0m_1","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"OpenClaw session.typingMode default value \\\"instant\\\" \\\"thinking\\\" \\\"never\\\"\",\n  \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n  \"count\": 1,\n  \"tookMs\": 1093,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a14ef864773bfd0f\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nConfiguration | Claw\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a14ef864773bfd0f\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://docs.claw.so/engine/gateway/configuration/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ed1b1f45a642697e\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nagents. defaults .typingMode: \\\"never\\\" | \\\"instant\\\" | \\\"thinking\\\" | \\\"message\\\". Defaults to instant for direct chats / mentions and message for unmentioned group chats.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ed1b1f45a642697e\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"docs.claw.so\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"OpenClaw session.typingMode default value \"instant\" \"thinking\" \"never\"","provider":"duckduckgo","count":1,"tookMs":1093,"externalContent":{"untrusted":true,"source":"web_search","provider":"duckduckgo","wrapped":true},"results":[{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"a14ef864773bfd0f\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nConfiguration | Claw\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"a14ef864773bfd0f\">>>","url":"https://docs.claw.so/engine/gateway/configuration/","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"ed1b1f45a642697e\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nagents. defaults .typingMode: \"never\" | \"instant\" | \"thinking\" | \"message\". Defaults to instant for direct chats / mentions and message for unmentioned group chats.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"ed1b1f45a642697e\">>>","siteName":"docs.claw.so"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780366614929}}
{"type":"message","id":"1db04216","parentId":"f90362f8","timestamp":"2026-06-02T02:17:00.045Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, I found the default value from the Claw docs:\n- Default is `\"instant\"` for direct chats / mentions\n- Default is `\"message\"` for unmentioned group chats\n\nSo the default is NOT a single value - it depends on context:- Direct chats/mentions → \"instant\"\n- Unmentioned group chats → \"message\"\n\nThis means when someone DMs the bot or @mentions it, typing indicator shows \"instant\". When in a group chat without being mentioned, it's \"message\".\n","thinkingSignature":"770699af49f7d57efc0cadc543ea3491a6ee9b6395ceb9b7a819d3f7ed977eae"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n找到了，官方文档说：\n\n> `agents.defaults.typingMode` 默认值是 **context-dependent（依赖上下文）**：\n> - **私聊 / 被 @：** `instant`（立即显示敲键盘）\n> - **群聊未被 @：** `message`（收到首字才显示）\n\n所以你的配置里没写 `typingMode`，走的就是这个默认值：\n- 私聊我 → instant（立即显示）\n- 群聊我 → message（等收到第一个字才显示）\n\n这就解释了为什么你私聊会看到敲键盘动画——是 `instant` 默认值在生效。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":361,"output":232,"cacheRead":88480,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":89073,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780366614942,"responseId":"066d701776bb1bce3d776dcf56cc951e"}}
